1. Embedded in EcuFps.exe
---------------------------
- NVIDIA NVAPI SDK headers
  Version/commit: 70d337db9186e968eab622f7e786de7e437faf3d (2026-09-18)
  Source: https://github.com/NVIDIA/nvapi
  License: MIT (third_party/nvapi/License.txt)
  Use: compile-time headers only. nvapi64.dll is not redistributed; it is
  loaded from System32 by the installed NVIDIA driver after signature
  verification (GPU-01/GPU-02). No static .lib is vendored.

- Microsoft MSVC CRT/STL
  Version: 14.44.35207
  License: Microsoft Visual C++ runtime terms; static linking into the
  application is permitted by the toolchain license. No VC++ redistributable
  is required at runtime (static /MT).

- JetBrains Mono 2.304 (font subset: Medium, SemiBold)
  Source: https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono/releases/tag/v2.304
  License: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (third_party/fonts/jetbrains-mono/OFL.txt)
  Use: subset (Latin + Turkish + UI symbols; fontTools) compiled into the EXE as
  byte arrays and loaded by DirectWrite as an in-memory font collection for the
  Panel's technical labels. No font file is written to disk or shipped loose.
  Copyright and license name records are kept inside the embedded fonts; the
  full license text is shown in Settings > Third-party licenses.

- 02/BOOST brand assets
  Version: 1.0.0
  Owner: Ecu Fps (user-provided asset package, ADR-017); not third-party OSS.
  Embedded as ICO/SVG resources, no loose asset files.

2. Vendored source compiled into developer/test tools only
----------------------------------------------------------
- Intel PresentMon - PresentData (ETW present consumer)
  Version/commit: v2.6.0 / e13fce6acdb55a808fd8318175a56863e532d95f
  Source: https://github.com/GameTechDev/PresentMon
  License: MIT (third_party/presentmon/LICENSE.txt)
  Use: static library ef_presentdata in the measurement layer. At the time
  of this package the measurement layer is linked only into test/tool
  binaries (ef_frame_probe, ef_game_capture); it is NOT linked into
  EcuFps.exe. The PresentMon service, PresentMonAPI2.dll, cereal and
  concurrentqueue are not included.

3. Not included / excluded
---------------------------
- AMD ADLX SDK: NOT included. The ADLX SDK License Agreement is not MIT and
  has not been accepted (blocker B-006); no headers are vendored and no ADLX
  code is linked. AMD adapter logic is compiled against an internal interface
  only and reports unsupported on AMD runtime paths until B-006 is resolved.
- Intel IGCL: NOT included. No Intel GPU is available on the build PC
  (blocker B-004); the capability remains unsupported and no ControlLib
  headers or runtime lookups are shipped.
- Windows system DLLs (user32, kernel32, gdi32, d2d1, dwrite, d3d11, dxgi,
  etc.): part of Windows; redistributed only by the OS, never copied into the
  package.
- Fonts and Windows visual assets: Segoe UI Variable and the other system
  fonts are used at runtime and not distributed. The only font shipped is the
  embedded JetBrains Mono subset listed in section 1 (no loose font file).
- Windows driver runtime DLLs: remain in their trusted System32 location and
  are loaded after signature verification; they are not packaged.

